OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service reveals 21 died
OL,4,Ain June heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Central Ambulance Service has
OL,7,Frevealed 21 patients died and nine were
OL,8,Fseverely harmed while it was under
OL,9,Fpressure during the summer heatwave in
OL,10,FJune.
OL,12,FThe incidents followed a huge rise in
OL,13,Fcalls to the service as temperatures
OL,14,Facross the South soared.
OL,16,FBoard papers show it has issued 39 duty
OL,17,Fof candour letters, part of its legal
OL,18,Fobligation to be open and transparent
OL,19,Fin the event of harm or death, to
OL,20,Faffected patients and families.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
