OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service reveals 21 died
OL,4,Ain June heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrust chief nurse Prof Helen Young said
OL,7,Fshe was "deeply sorry for the distress
OL,8,Fand harm" experienced by patients.
